  "content": "<h1><strong>AppleCore</strong></h1><p><br>一個用於修改Minecraft食物與飢餓機制的API。</p><p><strong>從Minecraft 1.10.2的v2.0.0版本開始，AppleCore的HUD相關功能已移至獨立模組：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/AppleCore/wiki/AppleCore-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多關於此模組功能的資訊，請參閱AppleCore的Github維基</a></p><p><em>注意：AppleCore本身並不會對Minecraft的飢餓機制進行任何修改。若要了解Minecraft的疲勞與飽食機制，請參閱<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fHunger%2523Mechanics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft維基中關於飢餓的文章</a></em></p><div>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>使用AppleCore的模組</strong></span></h2>\n<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hunger-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Hunger Overhaul</strong></a> - <em>對飢餓及相關機制的全面調整</em><br> <strong><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-spice-of-life\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Spice of Life</a></strong> - <em>透過遞減獎勵鼓勵飲食多樣化</em><br> <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hunger-in-peace\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Hunger In Peace</strong></a> - <em>和平模式下的正常飢餓與生命恢復<br></em><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hungertweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Hunger Tweaker</strong></a> - <em>將AppleCore API暴露給CraftTweaker腳本</em></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>給模組開發者</strong></span></h2><div><a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/AppleCore/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">開始使用AppleCore</a><br> <a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/AppleCore/wiki/Integrating-food-items-with-AppleCore\" rel=\"nofollow\">確保你的食物與AppleCore相容</a><br><a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/AppleCore/wiki/Integrating-plants-with-AppleCore\" rel=\"nofollow\">將植物與AppleCore整合</a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>截圖<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：從Minecraft 1.10.2的v2.0.0版本開始，這些功能已移至獨立模組：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>工具提示</strong><br> <em>按住Shift鍵時顯示食物營養值</em><br> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/bZGlvVN.png\" alt=\"\"><br> <br> <strong>飢餓/飽食HUD疊加</strong><br> <em>手持食物時，螢幕上會閃爍食用後可獲得的飢餓/飽食值</em><br> <img src=\"http://zippy.gfycat.com/PowerfulDeafeningHarvestmen.gif\" alt=\"\"><br> <br> <strong>食物疲勞HUD底層</strong><br> <em>食物疲勞值會以飢餓值後方的進度條顯示</em><br> <img src=\"http://zippy.gfycat.com/ShimmeringYearlyCicada.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他<br></strong></span></h2><div><strong><a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/squeek502\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong>歡迎將此模組加入任何你喜歡的模組包中。</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
